><p><b>dispenseRequest</b></p><p><b>validityPeriod</b>: 2015-03-25 --&gt; 2015-04-01</p><p><b>numberOfRepeatsAllowed</b>: 0</p><p><b>quantity</b>: 6 mL<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemL = 'mL')</span></p><h3>ExpectedSupplyDurations</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Value</b></td><td><b>Unit</b></td><td><b>System</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>5</td><td>days</td><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ucum.html\">http://unitsofmeasure.org</a></td><td>d</td></tr></table></blockquote></div>"
